# Google Maps Leads Scraper

Python project scaffold for collecting restaurant leads from Google Maps with Playwright and storing them in SQLite.

## Current scope

- Project structure
- Playwright setup
- Local SQLite database initialization

## Run the API

```bash
python -m pip install -e .
uvicorn lead_scraper.api:app --reload
```

The API is available at `http://localhost:8000`. Health check: `http://localhost:8000/health`.

## Setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -e .
playwright install
python scripts/init_db.py
```
